ager &lt;Kristen.Hager@tidalhealth.org&gt; <br><b>Sent:</b> Thursday, August 20, 2026 3:07 PM<br><b>To:</b> Marisa Gibaud &lt;marisa.gibaud@tidalhealth.org&gt;; Erin Cowder &lt;Erin.Cowder@tidalhealth.org&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Filippa Etherton &lt;Filippa.Etherton@tidalhealth.org&gt;; Alicia Warren &lt;alicia.warren@tidalhealth.org&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> Job Code/Job Description request- HR Issue Log Submission</span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Hi guys </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">&#128522;</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Laura Sturla posted the following submission on the HR Issue Log. Jaclyn Sanders is an RN in the ED and Eunice is in the Forensic Nurse Examiner role. Would it be okay for me to send her the program coordinator 987 JD as well as the FNE 292 JD to help her get started? Or do you guys already have a JD in the works for this?</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><img width=\"234\" height=\"412\" id=\"Picture_x0020_1\" src=\"cid:image001.png@01DD30B9.36725B10\" style=\"width:2.4416in; height:4.2916in\"></span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Thank you,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\">Kristen Hager <br></span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\">Senior HR Advisor <br>Human Resources Department<br><b>TidalHealth </b></span><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#1F4E79\">Peninsula Regional</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\"><br>O </span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\">410-912-6887</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\">F 410-543-4731<br>mytidalhealth.org</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Have a question for HR?&nbsp; Send it to our Shared Services team.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><a href=\"https://apps.powerapps.com/play/e/default-ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8/a/7f4b8c55-c804-4afa-93c3-f7308ddcbdae?tenantId=ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8&amp;hint=384e5157-8ea1-4b5c-912b-4a3979a7f5f3&amp;source=sharebutton&amp;sourcetime=1769439969989\">HR Questions &amp; Answers</a></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p></div></body></html>","bodyType":"html"}